# Changes to the security pipeline, its exceptions and its fixtures need the
# owner's review. With branch protection "Require review from Code Owners",
# nobody can quietly weaken a scanner or add an ignore rule in the same PR
# that would otherwise fail.
/.github/workflows/      @yasva
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @yasva
/.github/security-selftest/ @yasva
/.gitleaks.toml          @yasva
/.gitleaksignore         @yasva
/.trivyignore            @yasva
/.semgrepignore          @yasva
